cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QEHT in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "QEHT: QGIS Engineering Hydrology Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  An open-source QGIS Processing plugin for transparent, scriptable and
  testable DEM-based terrain, drainage-network and catchment analysis,
  with a QGIS-independent numerical core validated against a reference
  GIS platform's hydrology toolset.
authors:
  - family-names: "Akello"
    given-names: "Edmond"
version: 0.12.0
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
type: software
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - QGIS
  - digital elevation model
  - flow direction
  - catchment delineation
  - drainage network
